# Dependencies and build outputs are rebuilt inside the image
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/.turbo
**/.expo
**/.vercel
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# Secrets must never reach the build context
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/google-services.json
**/GoogleService-Info.plist

# npm lockfiles conflict with the pnpm workspace lockfile
**/package-lock.json

# Not needed by the api/admin images
.git
.github
.cursor
.vscode
.idea
apps/mobile
apps/web
docs
infrastructure
**/.DS_Store
